Percona LLC has made significant changes to the original work, including:
  - Per-(location, arch) datacenter circuit breakers and health tracking
    (DcCircuitBreaker, DcHealthTracker).
  - A native `arch` label and architecture-aware server/orphan metrics.
  - Prometheus metric provider and HTTP endpoint
    (metrics/HetznerMetricProvider, metrics/HetznerPrometheusEndpoint).
  - API rate-limit and retry interceptors (RateLimitInterceptor,
    RetryInterceptor) and a dedicated Hetzner API client (HetznerApiClient).
  - Worker rehydration after controller restart (HetznerWorkerRehydrator),
    hung-build detection (HungBuildDetector), and template error tracking
    (TemplateErrorTracker).
  - Retention, orphan-cleanup, and launcher hardening across the modified
    source files (see per-file "Modified by Percona" notices).

The full list of modified and added files is recorded in CHANGES.md.
